# Playwright route-smoke artifacts (scripts/playwright/route-smoke.config.ts)
test-results/

# Throwaway probe/audit specs. Investigating a defect here means dropping a
# scratch spec next to the code (vitest only picks up specs inside a package),
# and those files are transient by definition — they encode a hypothesis, not a
# contract. Ignored because `git add -A` swept a batch of them into five
# commits (2026-08-05) while an audit was mid-flight. A test worth keeping gets
# a real name.
zz-*.spec.ts
